OL,3,GNEWSAHelmet warning after woman's
OL,4,ACenter Parcs death
OL,5,
OL,6,FCenter Parcs says it has taken extra
OL,7,Fsteps to encourage staff to wear
OL,8,Fhelmets following the death of a staff
OL,9,Fmember in a freak accident three years
OL,10,Fago.
OL,12,FHousekeeping supervisor Penny Bulpitt
OL,13,Fwas riding a work bicycle when she was
OL,14,Fhit from behind by a maintenance worker
OL,15,Friding an electric buggy at the
OL,16,Fcompany's Woburn Forest resort near
OL,17,FAmpthill in Bedfordshire.
OL,19,FAn inquest heard the 67-year-old
OL,20,Fgrandmother was not wearing a helmet at
OL,21,Fthe time.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
